// headwear.hat, three-quarter: the low crown and wide brim seen turned toward
// screen right. Its x pixels hide the hair that would show above the brim (a
// topknot's bun and the edges of a hair cap) in every frame.
canvas 64 64
anchor 32 64
occludes hair_beard
frame idle 0
